{"release":{"id":377858442,"tag":"v1.1.1","author":"github-actions[bot]","name":"v1.1.1","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-08-27T13:47:14Z","publishedAt":"2026-08-27T13:52:38Z","markdown":"## Recipes\r\n- [[da704dd](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/da704dd9fd710df5c6c93ea2d31a028837d93d85)]: FocalCodec-Stream [ICASSP 2026] (#3050) (Luca Della Libera) [#3050](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3050)\r\n\r\n## Documentation\r\n- fix incorrect parameter description in load_data_json (#3053) [#3053](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3053) ([Bimochan raj kunwar](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/2827a48d4b471d76b22a7e8c46ee5b94ae0f90ea))\r\n- [[830d601](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/830d60112e70391c06d5956ef30c82b300af773b)]: add markdown files for agentic models (#3048) (Adel Moumen) [#3048](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3048)\r\n\r\n## Security\r\n- [[22a6166](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/22a616646a493871401461f80b2d5cf564cb2850)]: Use safeloader to load checkpoint meta files (#3067) (Peter Plantinga) [#3067](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3067)\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- mel_spectogram should be mel_spectrogram (#3063) [#3063](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3063) ([Access](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/2bafd45d6fb8eb4eb67f42533267a9df89a8986e))\r\n- Windows-incompatible python's inspect file guard in LazyModule (#3065) [#3065](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3065) ([Need-an-AwP](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/3d6d2daed93f886405d4d81cb045521ccb7a0d2f))\r\n- Decoder input tensor dimension error (#3049) [#3049](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3049) ([Paras](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/d4316ecab7cddb8fefcdc181a2fe6559a4dffd78))\r\n- [[9c826ef](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/9c826ef3937bac885c8a6ca86c6889a30f256fb5)]: Add hooks to ensure saving of kmeans model works correctly (#3047) (Peter Plantinga) [#3047](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3047)\r\n- [[8a89eba](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/8a89ebad72af734b75bbd37565ae96a6819e146b)]: Fix device handling for MPS (#3055) (flexthink) [#3055](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3055)\r\n- [[d0d15bb](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/d0d15bbb6578af683aa15c4214e0ac0c98108071)]: Fix incorrect documented defaults for HF wrapper freeze/output_norm (#3060) (#3062) (Deeksha Manjunath) [#3062](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3062)\r\n- [[e5cb1f6](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/e5cb1f65b940634215650aa1171e0440d0808123)]: Fix #3033: Fix closure variable bug in classification_error (#3061) (Nandana Dileep) [#3061](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3061)\r\n- [[841e205](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/841e205321029dec56c0354cda51bd2c2c6c29eb)]: Fix LoRA adapter support for convolutional layers (fixes #3056) (#3064) (oly) [#3064](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3064)\r\n- [[dff42ee](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/dff42eeb0cc5d5fd5fcd648a9d5fc162f7cd1fea)]: fix float columns being converted to string in from_csv (#3043) (Novikov Kirill) [#3043](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3043)\r\n- [[d9ee175](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/d9ee175897cbd31593456098c7c33b55b53d0379)]: Fix LengthsCapable containers dropping lengths for wav_lens-named layers (fixes #2986) (#3068) (oly) [#3068](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/3068)\r\n- [[825d024](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/commit/825d024659ec6d2b35f6a7206825de4b69d53404)]: Fixed TransformerST bug with ASR masks (#2984) (Filip Gębala) [#2984](https://github.com/speechbrain/speechbrain/pull/2984)","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\